/gh/m/api/*                  https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/gh/m/api/:splat                  200!
/gh/m/instant-virtuals/api/* https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/gh/m/instant-virtuals/api/:splat 200!
/gh/m/orders/*               https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/gh/m/orders/:splat               200!
/gh/m/pocket/*               https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/gh/m/pocket/:splat               200!
/gh/sportygames/api/*        https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/gh/sportygames/api/:splat        200!
/api/*                       https://YOUR-RENDER-BACKEND-URL.onrender.com/api/:splat                       200!

